# Harbour Notes

The ferry leaves at seven\. Café tables fill early\, and the señor at the counter pours coffee without asking\.

## Morning Tides

Gulls argue over crusts\; the crane operators wave\, and everyone says “good morning” in three languages\.

- Bread from the bakery on Rue Ménard
- Smoked fish\, naïve prices

